    "html": "<style>\n  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');\n\n  :root {\n    --color-ink-black: #030712;\n    --color-slate-mist: #4a5565;\n    --color-slate-mid: #6a7282;\n    --color-slate-cool: #364153;\n    --color-steel-veil: #90a1b9;\n    --color-fog-line: #cad5e2;\n    --color-pure-white: #ffffff;\n    --color-syntax-sky: #00a6f4;\n    --color-syntax-rose: #e60076;\n    --color-ocean-depth: #00598a;\n    --font-inter: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n    --font-ibm-plex-mono-plexmono: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\n  }\n\n  .cta-wrapper {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    background: var(--color-pure-white);\n    padding: 48px 40px;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .cta-eyebrow {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--color-syntax-sky);\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .cta-heading {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--color-ink-black);\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    letter-spacing: -0.05em;\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n    font-feature-settings: 'cv02', 'cv03', 'cv04', 'cv11';\n  }\n\n  .cta-body {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--color-slate-mist);\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin: 0 0 32px 0;\n  }\n\n  .cta-body code {\n    font-family: var(--font-ibm-plex-mono-plexmono);\n    font-size: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n    font-feature-settings: 'ss02', 'zero';\n  }\n\n  .cta-body .token-sky { color: var(--color-syntax-sky); }\n  .cta-body .token-rose { color: var(--color-syntax-rose); }\n\n  .cta-actions {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n\n  .btn-primary {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--color-pure-white);\n    background: #000000;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 32px;\n    padding: 8px 20px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    display: inline-block;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    font-feature-settings: 'cv02', 'cv03', 'cv04', 'cv11';\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  }\n\n  .btn-primary:hover {\n    background: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n\n  .search-bar {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    background: var(--color-pure-white);\n    border: 1px solid var(--color-fog-line);\n    border-radius: 32px;\n    padding: 7px 14px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    min-width: 200px;\n  }\n\n  .search-icon {\n    color: var(--color-slate-mid);\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .search-placeholder {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--color-steel-veil);\n    flex: 1;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n    font-feature-settings: 'cv02', 'cv03', 'cv04', 'cv11';\n  }\n\n  .search-kbd {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: var(--color-slate-mid);\n    background: var(--color-pure-white);\n    border: 1px solid var(--color-fog-line);\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 1px 5px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"cta-wrapper\">\n  <span class=\"cta-eyebrow\">Get started</span>\n  <h2 class=\"cta-heading\">A utility-first CSS framework.</h2>\n  <p class=\"cta-body\">\n    Packed with classes like <code class=\"token-sky\">flex</code>, <code class=\"token-sky\">pt-4</code>, <code class=\"token-rose\">text-center</code> and <code class=\"token-rose\">rotate-90</code> that can be composed to build any design, directly in your markup.\n  </p>\n  <div class=\"cta-actions\">\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-primary\">Get started</a>\n    <div class=\"search-bar\">\n      <span class=\"search-icon\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <path d=\"M7 13A6 6 0 1 0 7 1a6 6 0 0 0 0 12ZM15 15l-3.5-3.5\" stroke=\"#6a7282\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"search-placeholder\">Quick search</span>\n      <span class=\"search-kbd\">\u2318K</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "name": "CTA Button Group with Search Bar",
    "role": "",
    "description": ""
  },
  {
    "html": "<style>\n  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');\n\n  :root {\n    --color-ink-black: #030712;\n    --color-slate-mist: #4a5565;\n    --color-fog-line: #cad5e2;\n    --color-pure-white: #ffffff;\n    --color-syntax-sky: #00a6f4;\n    --font-inter: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .sponsors-wrapper {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    background: var(--color-pure-white);\n    padding: 48px 40px;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .sponsors-eyebrow {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--color-syntax-sky);\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    display: block;\n    font-feature-settings: 'cv02', 'cv03', 'cv04', 'cv11';\n  }\n\n  .sponsors-heading {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 36px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--color-ink-black);\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    letter-spacing: -0.05em;\n    margin: 0 0 16px 0;\n    font-feature-settings: 'cv02', 'cv03', 'cv04', 'cv11';\n  }\n\n  .sponsors-body {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--color-slate-mist);\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin: 0 0 28px 0;\n    max-width: 480px;\n    font-feature-settings: 'cv02', 'cv03', 'cv04', 'cv11';\n  }\n\n  .btn-sponsor {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--color-pure-white);\n    background: #000000;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 32px;\n    padding: 9px 20px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    font-feature-settings: 'cv02', 'cv03', 'cv04', 'cv11';\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n    margin-bottom: 36px;\n  }\n\n  .sponsors-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-fog-line);\n    border-left: 1px solid var(--color-fog-line);\n  }\n\n  .sponsor-cell {\n    border-right: 1px solid var(--color-fog-line);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-fog-line);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 28px 20px;\n    min-height: 80px;\n  }\n\n  .sponsor-name {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--color-ink-black);\n    letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n    font-feature-settings: 'cv02', 'cv03', 'cv04', 'cv11';\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .sponsor-icon {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"sponsors-wrapper\">\n  <span class=\"sponsors-eyebrow\">Sponsors</span>\n  <h2 class=\"sponsors-heading\">Supported by the best.</h2>\n  <p class=\"sponsors-body\">\n    Tailwind is supported by incredible partners and sponsors who make it possible for a team of talented designers and engineers to maintain the framework full-time.\n  </p>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-sponsor\">\n    Become a sponsor\n    <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n      <path d=\"M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n    </svg>\n  </a>\n  <div class=\"sponsors-grid\">\n    <div class=\"sponsor-cell\">\n      <span class=\"sponsor-name\">\n        <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M12 3C7.03 3 3 7.03 3 12s4.03 9 9 9 9-4.03 9-9-4.03-9-9-9zm0 2c1.66 0 3.18.55 4.4 1.46L5.46 16.4A6.96 6.96 0 0 1 5 14c0-3.86 3.14-7 7-7zm0 14c-1.66 0-3.18-.55-4.4-1.46l10.94-10.94A6.96 6.96 0 0 1 19 12c0 3.86-3.14 7-7 7z\" fill=\"#030712\"/>\n        </svg>\n        Google AI Studio\n      </span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sponsor-cell\">\n      <span class=\"sponsor-name\">\n        <svg width=\"18\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 18\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M2 2h8l2 4H2V2zM0 0v18h4v-6h16v6h4V6L18 0H0z\" fill=\"#030712\"/>\n        </svg>\n        Webflow\n      </span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sponsor-cell\">\n      <span class=\"sponsor-name\">\n        <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n          <rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#030712\"/>\n          <rect x=\"13\" y=\"3\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#030712\"/>\n          <rect x=\"3\" y=\"13\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#030712\"/>\n          <rect x=\"13\" y=\"13\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#030712\"/>\n        </svg>\n        Resend\n      </span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sponsor-cell\">\n      <span class=\"sponsor-name\">\n        <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5\" stroke=\"#030712\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n        </svg>\n        Profound\n      </span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sponsor-cell\">\n      <span class=\"sponsor-name\">\n        <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M12 2L2 12h4v8h5v-5h2v5h5v-8h4L12 2z\" fill=\"#030712\"/>\n        </svg>\n        Fin\n      </span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sponsor-cell\">\n      <span class=\"sponsor-name\">\n        <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n          <circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#030712\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#030712\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#030712\"/>\n        </svg>\n        Nutrient\n      </span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "name": "Sponsors Section",
    "role": "",
    "description": ""
  },
  {
    "html": "<style>\n  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');\n\n  :root {\n    --color-ink-black: #030712;\n    --color-slate-mist: #4a5565;\n    --color-slate-mid: #6a7282;\n    --color-slate-cool: #364153;\n    --color-fog-line: #cad5e2;\n    --color-pure-white: #ffffff;\n    --color-syntax-sky: #00a6f4;\n    --color-syntax-rose: #e60076;\n    --color-syntax-cyan: #74d4ff;\n    --color-mint-glow: #96f7e4;\n    --font-inter: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n    --font-ibm-plex-mono-plexmono: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\n  }\n\n  .badges-wrapper {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    background: var(--color-pure-white);\n    padding: 40px 40px;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .section-label {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n    color: var(--color-slate-mid);\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n    display: block;\n    font-feature-settings: 'cv02', 'cv03', 'cv04', 'cv11';\n  }\n\n  .demo-row {\n    margin-bottom: 32px;\n  }\n\n  .demo-row-label {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: var(--color-slate-mid);\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    display: block;\n    letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n  }\n\n  .demo-row-content {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n\n  /* Version Pill Badge */\n  .version-pill {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: var(--color-ink-black);\n    background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.05);\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    padding: 2px 6px 2px 10px;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 4px;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.05);\n    cursor: pointer;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n    font-feature-settings: 'cv02', 'cv03', 'cv04', 'cv11';\n  }\n\n  .version-pill .chevron {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    color: var(--color-slate-mid);\n  }\n\n  /* Primary CTA pill */\n  .pill-cta {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--color-pure-white);\n    background: #000000;\n    border-radius: 32px;\n    padding: 8px 20px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n    font-feature-settings: 'cv02', 'cv03', 'cv04', 'cv11';\n  }\n\n  /* Plus badge */\n  .plus-badge {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--color-pure-white);\n    background: #0ea5e9;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 2px 8px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n    font-feature-settings: 'cv02', 'cv03', 'cv04', 'cv11';\n  }\n\n  /* Inline code tags */\n  .inline-code-sky {\n    font-family: var(--font-ibm-plex-mono-plexmono);\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--color-syntax-sky);\n    letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n    font-feature-settings: 'ss02', 'zero';\n  }\n\n  .inline-code-rose {\n    font-family: var(--font-ibm-plex-mono-plexmono);\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--color-syntax-rose);\n    letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n    font-feature-settings: 'ss02', 'zero';\n  }\n\n  .inline-code-mint {\n    font-family: var(--font-ibm-plex-mono-plexmono);\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: #059669;\n    letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n    font-feature-settings: 'ss02', 'zero';\n  }\n\n  /* Prose demo */\n  .prose-demo {\n    font-family: var(--font-inter);\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--color-slate-cool);\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    background: var(--color-pure-white);\n    border: 1px solid var(--color-fog-line);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 20px 24px;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.04);\n    font-feature-settings: 'cv02', 'cv03', 'cv04', 'cv11';\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .divider {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-fog-line);\n    margin: 0 0 28px 0;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"badges-wrapper\">\n  <span class=\"section-label\">UI Tokens \u2014 Badges &amp; Inline Code</span>\n\n  <div class=\"demo-row\">\n    <span class=\"demo-row-label\">Version pill badge</span>\n    <div class=\"demo-row-content\">\n      <span class=\"version-pill\">\n        v4.2\n        <span class=\"chevron\">\n          <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\">\n            <path d=\"M3 4.5L6 7.5L9 4.5\" stroke=\"#6a7282\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </span>\n      </span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n  <div class=\"demo-row\">\n    <span class=\"demo-row-label\">Primary CTA + Plus nav badge</span>\n    <div class=\"demo-row-content\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"pill-cta\">Get started</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"pill-cta\" style=\"background:#1a1a1a;\">Become a sponsor \u2192</a>\n      <span class=\"plus-badge\">Plus</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n  <div class=\"demo-row\">\n    <span class=\"demo-row-label\">Inline code tokens \u2014 syntax colors</span>\n    <div class=\"demo-row-content\">\n      <code class=\"inline-code-sky\">flex</code>\n      <code class=\"inline-code-sky\">pt-4</code>\n      <code class=\"inline-code-sky\">items-center</code>\n      <code class=\"inline-code-rose\">text-center</code>\n      <code class=\"inline-code-rose\">rotate-90</code>\n      <code class=\"inline-code-mint\">rounded-2xl</code>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n  <div class=\"demo-row\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">\n    <span class=\"demo-row-label\">Prose with inline code in context</span>\n    <div class=\"prose-demo\">\n      A utility-first CSS framework packed with classes like <code class=\"inline-code-sky\">flex</code>, <code class=\"inline-code-sky\">pt-4</code>, <code class=\"inline-code-rose\">text-center</code> and <code class=\"inline-code-rose\">rotate-90</code> that can be composed to build any design, directly in your markup.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "name": "Version Pill Badge + Inline Code Tags",
    "role": "",
    "description": ""
  },
  {
    "name": "Primary CTA Button",
    "role": "Main calls to action \u2014 'Get started', 'Become a sponsor'",
    "description": "Black (#000000) background, white text, 32px border radius (pill shape), 8px top/bottom padding, 16px left/right padding. Inter 400 at 14px. No border visible \u2014 the fill is the form. High contrast 21:1 against white backgrounds. The pill shape is the only rounded UI element at this scale."
  },
  {
    "name": "Dark Code Badge Button",
    "role": "Version label and secondary tags inside dark sections",
    "description": "Nearly transparent dark background (oklab ~5% black), white text, 4px border radius, 4px vertical padding, 8px horizontal padding. 1px inset white shadow at 5% opacity creates a subtle border without a hard color. Inter 400 at 13px."
  },
  {
    "name": "Ghost Dark Button",
    "role": "Secondary actions within dark code editor UI",
    "description": "Transparent background, white text, 4px radius, 4px/8px padding. 1px inset white border at full opacity. Identical shape to Dark Code Badge but with fully opaque border, making it read as outlined rather than ghosted."
  },
  {
    "name": "Version Pill Badge",
    "role": "Current version tag in navigation (v4.2)",
    "description": "~5% black background on light page, near-black text (#030712), 16px border radius, 2px top/bottom padding, 10px left padding, 6px right padding. Inset 1px ring shadow in near-black at 5% opacity. Inter at 13px weight 500."
  },
  {
    "name": "Inline Code Tag",
    "role": "Class name references in body text (flex, pt-4, text-center)",
    "description": "Colored text (Syntax Sky #00a6f4, Syntax Rose #e60076, or Mint Glow #96f7e4 depending on token type) on white background. No background fill on the tag itself \u2014 color alone signals code. IBM Plex Mono at 14px with +0.1em letter-spacing and 'ss02'/'zero' features."
  },
  {
    "name": "Search Input Bar",
    "role": "Quick search command palette trigger in header",
    "description": "Transparent background, 0px border radius, no visible padding. Black text (#000000) with keyboard shortcut hint (\u2318K) in Slate Mid (#6a7282). No box shadow or border in rest state \u2014 completely borderless, distinguished only by a search icon and the shortcut badge."
  },
  {
    "name": "Sponsor Logo Card",
    "role": "Partner and sponsor logos in the 'Supported by the best' section",
    "description": "White background, no border or shadow. Black monochrome logo treatment \u2014 all sponsor logos rendered in solid black (or close to it) against white. Logos displayed at ~40\u201360px height in a 4-column responsive grid with 24px column gap. No hover state visible."
  },
  {
    "name": "Navigation Bar",
    "role": "Top sticky header with brand, links, and utilities",
    "description": "White background, full width. Tailwind CSS logomark left-aligned. Nav links (Docs, Blog, Showcase, Sponsor) in Inter 400 14px, Ink Black (#030712). 'Plus' link rendered as a bright blue pill badge. GitHub icon and search icon at right. 8px gap between items. No bottom border or shadow \u2014 floats above content."
  },
  {
    "name": "Section Label",
    "role": "Eyebrow text above section headings ('SPONSORS')",
    "description": "All-caps, Inter 600 at 12px, tracking wider. Syntax Sky (#00a6f4) or brand accent color. Placed 8px above the section heading. Signals section identity without competing with the heading weight."
  },
  {
    "name": "Card with Inset Ring Shadow",
    "role": "Image cards and UI preview cards throughout the page",
    "description": "White or near-white background, 8px border radius, inset shadow: `oklab(0.129999 -0.00404751 -0.027702 / 0.1) 0px 0px 0px 1px inset` \u2014 a 1px near-black ring at 10% opacity. This replaces a border entirely; the shadow approach means no box-model interference with layout. No outer drop shadow."
  },
  {
    "name": "Card with Elevation Shadow",
    "role": "Elevated cards that need more depth (overlaid preview cards)",
    "description": "White background, 8px radius. Compound shadow: `oklab(white/0.2) 0px 0px 0px 1px inset, oklab(black/0.1) 0px 0px 0px 1px, rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 0px 1px 3px 0px, rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 0px 1px 2px -1px`. Inner white ring + outer dark ring + 1-3px drop shadow. Depth without dramatic lifting."
  }
]
